      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sharable playlists would be excellent as a way to curate good stuff and pass them around. Would love something like this.The world favorites can technically be made public but they're not easily sharable so something that uses the share function already built into VRC to toss someone a \"pack\" of worlds would be great.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
